  "scope": "Physical slice scheduling and active and combined retry owner admission each leave the last slot available for resident terrain. The Release baseline keeps 256 cold slice results ready and applies zero resident slices at terrain capacity. The corrected Flat fixture keeps 255 cold credits, uses the existing 256th for the resident, and completes its full signed column before any cold publication. It preserves the original cold owner and subsequently installs the deferred streaming demand. The existing hard limits remain 256 physical reads, 32 concurrent column plans and 256 combined active plans and retry timers.",
  "remaining": "Whole-world cardinality still needs procedural generation including cross-column writes, cooperative loading, direct edits, record-only owners and the live disk index and registry. The startup-only runs leave motion, outer-ring, cave, wet, visual and performance acceptance open. Full S0-S6 acceptance remains open at 23 of 42 packages.",
